\begin{document}

\title{LilyPond in \LaTeX: Hello World}
\author{Overleaf Support Testing}
\date{\today}
\maketitle

This is a standard text paragraph in \LaTeX. Below is a minimal musical 
example rendered automatically using LilyPond.

\begin{lilypond}[fragment,staffsize=16]
  \key c \major
  \time 4/4
  c'4 d' e' f' | g'2 g'2 \bar "|."
\end{lilypond}

The musical fragment above blends into the document layout.

\end{document}